{"data":{"body":"**P1 \u2014 Publish fatal restoration failures to the caller.** This `finally` completes `result` with the selected outcome even when MDC restoration throws `VirtualMachineError` or `ThreadDeath` on an asynchronous executor. The caller can receive success or `PENDING` while only the worker dies. Complete the result exceptionally with the fatal before rethrowing it, and publish the selected outcome only after restoration succeeds.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77L0cM","finding_digest":"d43371534e39ba8ef3db8885e66b122c9182a4cc77f87519192245519be87d31","finding_id":"arf_v1_2qzxcu2ohg5i5463rcc6m2ysfs","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::fatal-cleanup-propagation","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::fatal-cleanup-propagation","line":275,"observation_digest":"d1f818684c13c4aa572fe4537dd47d0dd62139b53722ea5e9428c1b545f30514","observation_id":"aro_v1_2h4bq2cmcpckuvzp4rjx3vd5bx","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_2qzxcu2ohg5i5463rcc6m2ysfs","published_at":"2026-10-08T03:06:51Z","review_id":"arr_v1_c2usoqym5ckwbtcjab5hzdhwpt","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"4cc0f356ca4356dd098c503ca66555819d92391f","reviewer":"codex","start_line":273,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_hp7aibdweq2sxyln7du5iiibcc","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T03:06:51Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
